License status

The authors selected Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
for the LEVI manuscript. That selection concerns the manuscript and does not
by itself assign a license to the code, benchmark data or generated-image corpus.

A code/data license has not yet been selected for this repository. This repository
does not grant a new public license to those materials. Any third-party
materials remain subject to their respective terms. A final license inventory
will be completed before a public release.
